      "mergedPostDetails": "I had a friend tell we last night that they visited my unpublished private world and described to me in great detail stuff that I literally just added minutes before. Apparently if you have your unpublished world's set as your home it will show up as public till you leave the world and people can join it without needing a invitation.  This is a really big problem because this bug can cause people to unknowingly and unwillingly violate the tos. Please fix this as soon as possible. I have changed my home to some generic world till the bug is fixed as I don't want people snooping around  my world  playing with stuff that I had planned to keep secret till I published the world.",
